      "value": "@{6383c53a374b140ec9a2ed0e|full_name}: That sucks to hear. I moved to Index last year to get away from a hybrid full body setup, so I have not used my Rift in some time.\n\nUnfortunately unless this can be reliably reproduced, or becomes a huge issue with Quest devices, I doubt this will be fixed. At least the workaround of increasing the TdrDelay does the job. \n\nI didn't realise until you replied here that I still have my computer set to a TdrDelay of 6 this whole time.\n\nIn the off chance the new staff have not properly triaged the backlog of reported issues internally, it might be worth searching for any other recent reports then creating a new canny combining the new and old links. Gives it a chance to be seen again and properly merged.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
